---
name: ask-before-publishing
description: Commit, push, deploy and send are separate steps, each needing approval
metadata:
  type: feedback
---

Ask before each of commit, push, deploy or sending email/SMS, and report the
result of each step separately.

**Why:** these are hard to undo and visible to other people.
**How to apply:** finish the local work, show what will change, then wait for a yes.
